  "description": "De-identification for conversation transcripts, so they can be analysed by an AI without carrying the people in them. Built for text that came out of a speech recogniser: it matches the identifiers you already know through ASR spelling damage, replaces names with consistent invented names under a HIPAA Safe Harbor policy, and measures its own leak rate. No external dependencies.",
